      "message": "chore(git): stop tracking Python bytecode\n\nThe laser stack's icons commit (1d174e09c) added 17 .pyc blobs under\nsite/tests/__pycache__ and site/tools/__pycache__. Each site test run\nrewrote them, and they were the only conflicts of #4288. They leave the\nindex, and .gitignore ignores __pycache__/ and *.pyc in the whole tree.\n\nFixes #4386\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
